# Reference-only checkout of the lunar-manip Python scenarios, and its own git
# repo. It is here to read and compare against, never to load from: this project
# resolves every runtime asset under data/, and nothing in src/, main.cpp,
# CMakeLists.txt or the ROS 2 package refers to it. The one IK module that used
# to be imported from it at runtime now lives at
# ros2_ws/src/amd_uw_ros2/amd_uw_ros2/inverse_kinematics.py.
ros2_ws/src/lunar-manip/
